# Alo King Broadcast Compliance and Personalized AI Campaigns

## Executive summary

Alo King should combine two systems:

1. A **permission-first broadcast engine** that protects WhatsApp quality, customer trust, and the shared business portfolio quota.
2. A **personalized recommendation engine** that selects the most relevant food suggestion for each eligible customer without allowing the AI to control consent, pricing, safety, or delivery truth.

The LLM should generate conversational wording and campaign ideas. Deterministic backend services must control consent, audience eligibility, ranking constraints, prices, inventory, budget, message limits, and final sending.

---

# Part I — WhatsApp opt-in compliance and rate limits

## 1. Separate transactional and marketing consent

Do not treat placing an order as automatic permission for restaurant promotions.

Meta requires that the customer:

1. Provides their mobile number or WhatsApp identity.
2. Gives permission to receive subsequent messages from the business.
3. Clearly understands which business they are opting in to receive messages from.

Recommended consent categories:

| Consent type | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Transactional** | Order confirmations, delivery updates, payment messages, support |
| **Alo King recommendations** | Personalized food suggestions from Alo King |
| **Restaurant offers** | Promotions from restaurants the customer has ordered from |
| **Calls** | Voice calls or call-back requests, if introduced later |

A customer who agrees to order updates should not automatically be enrolled in restaurant marketing.

## 2. Recommended opt-in wording

### English

> Yes, I want to receive occasional offers and new-menu updates from restaurants I order from through Alo King on WhatsApp. I can stop restaurant offers at any time by replying STOP.

### Lebanese Arabic

> نعم، بوافق استلم أحياناً عروض وتحديثات من المطاعم اللي بطلب منها عبر Alo King على واتساب. فيني أوقف عروض المطاعم بأي وقت عبر إرسال STOP أو إيقاف العروض.

### Restaurant-specific wording

> Would you like **[Restaurant Name]** to send you occasional offers and new-menu updates through Alo King on WhatsApp? You can mute this restaurant or reply STOP at any time.

Restaurant campaigns should normally target customers who:

- explicitly opted in;
- previously ordered from that restaurant;
- have not muted that restaurant;
- are not globally opted out;
- are inside applicable frequency limits.

## 3. Store auditable consent records

For each opt-in, store:

```text
customer_id
phone_hash
business_or_restaurant_id
consent_category
consent_text_version
language
source
timestamp
session_reference
whatsapp_message_id
