## 23. Automatic decision policy

```text
Valid consent?
  no  → exclude
  yes → continue

Restaurant-specific permission?
  no  → exclude
  yes → continue

Global or restaurant opt-out?
  yes → exclude
  no  → continue

Frequency cap passed?
  no  → defer
  yes → continue

Portfolio quota available?
  no  → schedule later
  yes → continue

Template approved and acceptable quality?
  no  → block
  yes → continue

Item, price, location, and fulfilment valid?
  no  → block or regenerate
  yes → continue

Small test batch passed?
  no  → pause
  yes → expand gradually
```

