## Bottom line

Alo King should not optimize for the largest broadcast. It should optimize for the highest number of **incremental completed orders per delivered promotional message without increasing blocks, complaints, or opt-outs**.

The winning formula is:

> **Explicit consent + restaurant-specific audiences + strict limits + live menu validation + deterministic personalization + short approved messages + paced rollout + campaign-aware conversation + holdout measurement.**

